{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10001","headline":"省试方士进恒春草 · 梁鍠","name":"省试方士进恒春草","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东吴有灵草，生彼剡谿傍。\n既乱莓苔色，仍连菡萏香。\n掇之称远士，持以奉明王。\n北阙颜弥驻，南山寿更长。\n金膏徒骋妙，石髓莫矜良。\n倘使沾涓滴，还游不死方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁鍠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}